# Answer keys, patches and holdout never go in the image. Listed explicitly
# (no negation rules) so every ignore engine agrees. fixtures/questions/sample
# ships: src/lib/sources.ts imports its source data at build time (as would
# fixtures/sources and fixtures/questions/tags in a full deployment). A NEW
# fixtures subfolder ships by default - add it here if it holds answers.
fixtures/exams.json
fixtures/key-permutations.json
fixtures/questions/*.json
fixtures/questions/additions
fixtures/questions/holdout
fixtures/questions/patches
tasks
scripts/sql
.env*
*.md
